      "summary": "Presents a short thesis detailing why Yelp is a classic value trap trading at ~10x earnings and ~1x revenue despite decelerating top-line growth and falling ad clicks. Highlights severe operational issues, including aggressive cold-calling sales practices and intense competitive disruption from platforms like TikTok, Instagram, Beli, and AI-driven search agents.",
